ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\",\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\",\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 업무가 ACCEPTED(접수)되었습니다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 업무가 ACCEPTED(접수)되었습니다.\",\"wrong_first\":false,\"evidence\":[\"E5394\",\"E5403\",\"P:1:f21a5a3e-e378-41ca-9d62-7ad80aa70add\"],\"reason\":\"첫 핵심 응답은 새 업무가 접수됐고 아직 완료되지 않았다는 사실을 정확히 알립니다.\"}],\"cycle\":{\"valid_publication_id\":null,\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"evidence\":[\"E5352\",\"E5572\",\"E5614\",\"E5643\",\"P:2:0c322cf9-605a-4348-a1b2-bea26849b315\"],\"reason\":\"두 번째 산출물은 실제 생성·전달됐지만, E1의 기준과 가격 제외를 반영하지 않아 요구된 ProposalRepeat@v1 최종 전달 endpoint를 충족하지 않습니다.\"},\"critical_violations\":[],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0b39b55b2a3f05e4016acc248b90cc87d0a2924ad03cd51052","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_object"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":20458,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":1017,"cached_tokens":19438},"output_tokens":1864,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":859},"total_tokens":22322},"user":null}
